<!--
  wp81_glyph_missed_call

  The mark the People tile wears while a call has gone unanswered - a handset with the
  arrow that says the call came in and was not taken. Its own drawable rather than
  something folded into wp81_glyph_people: the tile shows one or the other, and which of
  them it is *is* the notification.

  The supplied path is minified SVG - ".6.6" for two numbers, flags run into the value
  after them - which is legal and which the platform's parser does handle. It has been
  re-emitted here with every parameter separated, because a drawable that fails to parse
  fails when the tile is inflated rather than when the app is built.

  Emitted white so callers can tint per accent / light-dark theme.
-->
